    "eerie": {
      "word": "EERIE; EERY",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "Serving to inspire fear, esp. a dread of seeing ghosts; wild; weird; as, eerie stories. She whose elfin prancer springs By night to eery warblings. Tennyson.",
